  "name": "楓原萬葉",
  "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">紅葉逐荒波 · 楓原萬葉</span></p><p>拾花鳥之一趣，照月風之長路。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/07/14/125391187/86860a04df9541ce4306a533190e469b_8752245246456131541.png",
